OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 4 APR
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GThe Spanish vocal ensemble Qvinta
OL,6,     GEssencia showcase the polyphonic
OL,7,     Gmusical tradition and poetry that
OL,8,     Gflourished in the Iberian
OL,9,     Gpeninsula of the 16th century.
OL,10,G0630FBreakfast
OL,11,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     GBreakfast show. You can contact
OL,13,     Gthe show by emailing
OL,14,     G3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,16,     GTom Service introduces the
OL,17,     Gperfect classical soundtrack for
OL,18,     Gthe weekend, and meets acclaimed
OL,19,     GFrench conductor Raphael Pichon.
